sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant L as Claim ledger
  participant S as Monitor stats
  participant W as Portal watcher
  participant M as LLM explainer
  participant A as Analyst
  participant R as Rule table
  participant N as News board

  Note over S: Runs daily
  L->>S: Outcomes by payer / code / week
  S->>S: Detect spike, e.g. Harbor D04 up 3x
  W->>W: Check official portal for new bulletins
  S->>M: Spike details + recent claims
  W->>M: New bulletin text
  M-->>A: Likely cause + draft rule change + draft news post
  A->>R: Approve rule version v+1 with effective date
  A->>N: Publish rule-change post
  Note over R: Predictor uses v+1 for claims<br/>with dates on or after the effective date
  L->>S: Units used per authorization
  S->>S: Forecast run-out date
  S->>N: Auth alert to scheduler
